now.com/docs/r/it-asset-management/enterprise-asset-management/script-include-shipping-carrier-integrations-eam.html","release":"australia","product":"Enterprise Asset Management","classification":"enterprise-asset-management","topic_type":"reference","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":1,"breadcrumb":["Configuring shipping","Configure","Enterprise Asset Management","IT Asset Management"],"tags":["#it-asset-management","#enterprise-assets","#eam","#facilities","#equipment","#type-reference"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/it-asset-management/enterprise-asset-management/script-include-shipping-carrier-integrations-eam.md"},
